<title>UK: Butte suspended ahead of annual report.</title>
<headline>Butte suspended ahead of annual report.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in mining group Butte Mining Plc were suspended temporarily on Thursday at the company's request.</p>
<p>The stock exchange said the shares were suspended pending publication of the company's annual report and accounts for the period ending June 30, 1996.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
</text>
